  "content": "\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@pla_is_me\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/dxehc2hn3/image/upload/v1761811663/youtube_icon_bcbanf.png\" alt=\"YouTube\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\"></a> &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp; <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.com%252finvite%252fEsvPsnqJpz\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/dxehc2hn3/image/upload/v1761811736/discord_icon_bg_rp4omx.png\" alt=\"Discord\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\"></a> &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp; <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fpla_is_me\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/dxehc2hn3/image/upload/v1761815764/kofi_icon_bg_sy3foi.png\" alt=\"Ko‑fi\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\"></a> &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp; <a href=\"https://github.com/PlaIsMe\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/dxehc2hn3/image/upload/v1761811682/github_icon_bg_wmtjei.png\" alt=\"Github\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\"></a></p>\n<p><strong>Combat Evolution x EpicFight : Resurrection</strong> 是一款為 <strong>Combat Evolution</strong> 與 <strong>EpicFight : Resurrection</strong> 增加相容性的附加模組。</p>\n<p>本模組會停用 EpicFight: Resurrection 的內建處決系統，並將其與&nbsp;<strong>Combat Evolution'</strong> 的處決機制整合。使用此模組時，您可以在 Combat Evolution 的處決機制中播放來自 EpicFight : Resurrection 的處決動畫；此外，該模組也修復了 EpicFight Resurrection 的 Yamato 崩潰問題。</p>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><strong>⚠️ 本模組已從 Annoying Villagers x EpicFight: Resurrection 拆分出來</strong></span></h2>\n<p style=\"color:#fc0;font-size:22px;font-weight:bold;text-align:center\"><span><iframe style=\"width:721px\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/ito-fUdAimY\" width=\"721\" height=\"420\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></p>",
